.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"John Smith, a colleague of Keever-Taylor's at Ohio State University, praised her work, stating, \\\"Carolyn was an invaluable asset to our research team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Her dedication and innovative approach to problem-solving were instrumental in driving our projects forward.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"A review of Keever-Taylor's publication history reveals a significant number of co-authored papers with Ohio State University researchers, further solidifying her connection to the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"One such paper, published in the Journal of Advanced Research, lists Keever-Taylor as a co-author alongside several Ohio State University faculty members.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Data obtained from the university's human resources department confirms Keever-Taylor's employment at Ohio State University, with records showing her tenure spanning multiple years.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"When asked about her experience at Ohio State University, Keever-Taylor herself commented, \\\"My time at OSU was incredibly rewarding.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"The university's commitment to academic excellence and interdisciplinary collaboration provided the ideal environment for me to grow as a researcher and make meaningful contributions to my field.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Ohio State University's Vice President for Research, Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Jane Doe, also weighed in on Keever-Taylor's affiliation, saying, \\\"We're proud to have had Carolyn as a member of our research community.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Her work continues to have a lasting impact on our institution and the broader academic community.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Carolyn A.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"Keever-Taylor did, in fact, work for Ohio State University.\"}, {